# Area sparkline over SparklineMixedData (Value 30,-10,40,-20,30,40,-10,30) with the normal range
# visible between 15 and 25.
Then the normal range will be visible
Then the sparkline will have a normal range between 15 and 25
Then this sparkline will display lines with the following properties:
  | PointType  | X | Y   |
  | StartPoint | 0 | 30  |
  | WayPoint   | 1 | -10 |
  | WayPoint   | 2 | 40  |
  | WayPoint   | 3 | -20 |
  | WayPoint   | 4 | 30  |
  | WayPoint   | 5 | 40  |
  | WayPoint   | 6 | -10 |
  | WayPoint   | 7 | 30  |
  | WayPoint   | 7 | 0   |
  | WayPoint   | 0 | 0   |
When this sparklines vertical axis visibility is Visible
Then this sparkline will have a vertical axis with a top value of 40 and a bottom value of -20
